OL,3,GNEWSADoctors want more Noble's Hospital
OL,4,Ainpatient beds                         
OL,6,FDoctors have called for more inpatient 
OL,7,Fbeds to be provided at Noble's Hospital
OL,8,Fin response to a government assessment 
OL,9,Fof Manx Care's performance.            
OL,11,FThe Isle of Man Medical Society (IMMS) 
OL,12,Fsaid the report confirmed a "structural
OL,13,Fshortage of physical inpatient beds,   
OL,14,Frather than solely a discharge         
OL,15,Fchallenge" at the hospital in Braddan, 
OL,16,Fnear Douglas.                          
OL,18,FIt also raised concerns about the use  
OL,19,Fof "private surgical teams" on the     
OL,20,Fisland, something it said had led to   
OL,21,Flocal surgeons' operating sessions     
OL,22,Fbeing cancelled.                       
