OL,3,GNEWSADoctors want more Noble's Hospital
OL,4,Ainpatient beds                         
OL,6,FThe Department of Health and Social    
OL,7,FCare (DHSC) assessment also found Manx 
OL,8,FCare missed cancer waiting time targets
OL,9,Fand ended 2025/26 with a #14.9m        
OL,10,Fdeficit.                               
